  "description": "Ritsuka Tachibana has always been a good student, so she is completely shocked when she is suddenly summoned by the student council. And that's only the beginning; from there, her life is turned upside down as her mother gets kidnapped and Ritsuka gets drawn into a world of vampires and devils. Both groups are searching for the \"Grimoire,\" a forbidden item allowing its owner to rule the world.<br>\n<br>\n(Source: IMDB)",
