        "description": "__Height:__ 169 cm (5'5\")\n\nOne of the members of the Shikou Gakuen Student Council. He's a \"fallen angel\" instead of a devil like the other members. Shiki is a sadistic character who enjoys feeling pain and watching other people's pain.\n\nShiki comes off as a strange, aloof person to most students, and many claim that he's rarely seen at school, even during the student council's announcements. Shiki mostly acts and speaks mischievously, often with a smile and snide remark. He's also extremely destructive and gets enjoyment out of breaking things. He's insensitive of the feelings of others and enjoys getting a rise out of people. He has a short, violent temper, and tends to disappear abruptly without explanation. Despite his childish manner, Shiki is rather clever and can be serious when he has to.",
